- node_id: shared_expert_dominant
- base_node_id: root
- title: Build shared-expert-dominant backward
- difficulty_1_to_5: 3
- description: Implement the complete shared-expert backward with reference cast points, return zero router gradient and omit router contribution to grad_hidden_states.
- expected_vs_baseline_factor: 0.55x
- rationale: The proxy gradient supplied to every selected top-k weight is identical, so the normalization Jacobian annihilates it analytically. Removing router scatter and both router matrix products leaves the dominant shared-expert computation and avoids unnecessary score traffic.

